{"id":2306,"date":"2026-08-27T07:15:23","date_gmt":"2026-08-27T07:15:23","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=2306"},"modified":"2026-08-27T16:24:22","modified_gmt":"2026-08-27T16:24:22","slug":"word-count-text-statistics","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/accessibility\/word-count-text-statistics\/","title":{"rendered":"Word Count &#038; Text Statistics"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Word Count &amp; Text Statistics<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-2314 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WordCountAndTextStatistics.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"348\" height=\"245\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WordCountAndTextStatistics.webp 1422w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WordCountAndTextStatistics-300x212.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WordCountAndTextStatistics-1024x723.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WordCountAndTextStatistics-768x542.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 348px) 100vw, 348px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Whether you are drafting a flyer, a brochure, or a full resume, Open Publisher provides tools to help you easily keep track of your text length without leaving the editor.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Live Status Bar Tracking<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">A dynamic word count indicator is built directly into the bottom status bar, sitting cleanly next to the page count. This indicator automatically appears whenever you select a text box and updates in real-time as you type, giving you an immediate view of your<br \/>\nword count at a glance.<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-2312\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/StatusBar-WC.webp_202608270817-scaled.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"771\" height=\"28\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/StatusBar-WC.webp_202608270817-scaled.jpeg 2560w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/StatusBar-WC.webp_202608270817-300x11.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/StatusBar-WC.webp_202608270817-1024x37.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/StatusBar-WC.webp_202608270817-768x28.jpeg 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/StatusBar-WC.webp_202608270817-1536x56.jpeg 1536w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/StatusBar-WC.webp_202608270817-2048x74.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 771px) 100vw, 771px\" \/><\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Detailed Statistics Dialog<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2309 alignright\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WordCountDialog.webp\" alt=\"Open Publisher Text Statistics dialog box\" width=\"305\" height=\"304\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WordCountDialog.webp 582w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WordCountDialog-300x300.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WordCountDialog-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 305px) 100vw, 305px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">If you need more detailed metrics beyond a simple word count, you can open the comprehensive <strong>Text Statistics<\/strong> modal. You can access this dialog in two ways:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Click the live word count directly in the bottom status bar.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to the <strong>Review<\/strong> tab in the ribbon and click <strong>Word Count<\/strong> in the Proofing group.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p class=\"western\">The dialog provides an exact breakdown of your text, including:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Words<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Characters (no spaces)<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Characters (with spaces)<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Paragraphs<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Lines<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p align=\"center\">\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Word Count &amp; Text Statistics Whether you are drafting a flyer, a brochure, or a full resume, Open Publisher provides tools to help you easily keep track of your text length without leaving the editor. Live Status Bar Tracking A dynamic word count indicator is built directly into the bottom status bar, sitting cleanly next [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2314,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[23],"class_list":["post-2306","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-accessibility"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2306","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\